# Render phase for the FORWARD walker (126; 114's render phase, extracted from
# rae in #552). The scene draws in the forward renderer's `forward` step:
# beginForwardPass, the same draws 114 makes into its G-buffer (terrain, props,
# physics cubes, the skinned walker and crowd, grass), endForwardPass. There is
# no water, splash or underwater step; SSAO comes with forward-rae-6.
#
# The three render functions — the shadow pass, the G-buffer pass, and renderApp
# (animation sample + render-graph walk) — moved verbatim from rae with no
# behaviour change. Example-126 files are siblings that merge into one module, so
# the App/State types and the sibling helpers (terrain/character/hud) still
# resolve; rae keeps createApp / updateApp / the loop. The import block below
# is rae's (a superset — some entries are unused here but harmless).

